# Licensing Notice

This repository is a polyglot monorepo that aggregates several independently
maintained projects. Each project keeps its original licensing terms. To
determine the license that governs a specific codebase or asset, read the
`LICENSE`, `COPYING`, or equivalent notice located inside that project’s
subdirectory. Those files describe the exact permissions, obligations, and
exceptions that apply.

If you plan to redistribute or contribute to code in this monorepo, make sure
you comply with the license of the project you touch. When in doubt, review the
license file packaged with that project or consult its upstream repository for
the canonical text.
